			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"松本"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 721850201,
					"content": "唉，這個世界上還有能滿足我味蕾的新奇菜餚嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721850202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "松本"
				},
				{
					"id": 721850202,
					"content": "關於「木南料亭」的披薩…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721850203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721850203,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}說那個披薩啊，味道確實不錯，還融合了不少當地的食材。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721850204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "松本"
				},
				{
					"id": 721850204,
					"content": "不過，我之前也嘗過正宗的「烤蘑菇披薩」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721850205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "松本"
				},
				{
					"id": 721850205,
					"content": "我記得，那種披薩是由乳酪，高麗菜和蘑菇做成的來著…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721850206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "松本"
				},
				{
					"id": 721850206,
					"content": "哈哈哈，我個人是覺得，這種異國的食物，最好還是保持著異國的特色比較好啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "松本"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7218503,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7218503
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
